      "text_raw": "Active entities: Ferraro, Lopatin, Miles Bowe, Robin Burnett, Far Side Virtual, Last FM, Luxury Elite, MediaFire. Topic: it was defined engagement Frequencies , Transmuteo ( Jonathan Dean ) , Coolmemoryz , and Prismcorp[63 ] Numerous producers of this online milieu took inspiration from Ramona Langley 's New Dreams Ltd. ( credited to \" Laserdisc Visions \" , July 2011 ) .[63 ] The first reported use of the term \" vaporwave \" was in an October 2011 blog post by an anonymous user reviewing the album Surf 's Pure Hearts by Girlhood ; [41 ] however , Burnett has been credited with coining the term as a way to tie the circle together.[63 ] Langley 's Floral Shoppe ( credited to \" Macintosh Plus \" , December 2011 ) was the first album to be properly considered of the genre , containing all of the style 's core elements[25 ] Vaporwave found wider appeal over the middle of 2012 , building an audience on sites like Last.fm , Reddit and 4chan.[63 ] On Tumblr , it became common for users to decorate their pages with vaporwave imagery[59 ] In September , Blank Banshee released his debut album , Blank Banshee 0 , which reflected a trend of vaporwave producers who were more influenced by trap music and less concerned with conveying political undertones.[25 ] Bandwagon called it a \" progressive record \" that , along with Floral Shoppe , \" signaled the end of the first wave of sample-heavy music , and ... reconfigured what it means to make vaporwave music[3 ] Upcoming entities: Anthony Fantano, Ash Becks, Dummy Mag, Joe Price, Rihanna, YouTuber, Azealia Banks, Floral Shoppe. Next focus: After a flood of new vaporwave acts turned to Bandcamp for distribution",
