      "text_raw": "Active entities: Hyperreality, Lofi, Wojak, Digitality, Doomer, Memphis Group, Music, Y2 K. Topic: Form of protest subvert media culture Dead mall 2 . ^ This included the synthwave music genre , also known as \" outrun \" , although the latter term was later used to refer more generally to retro 1980s esthetics such as VHS tracking artifacts , magenta neon , and gridlines[55 ] 3 . ^ Author Emile Frankel cited the work as \" a seminal release \" and argued that Lopatin had captured \" the affect of vaporwave \" even earlier with the \" highly influential \" electronic album Betrayed in the Octagon ( 2007 ) [42 ] 4 . ^ Journalist Miles Bowe recalled that when he was an intern at Stereogum in 2013 , \" vaporwave felt nearly impossible to explain to friends , let alone pitch to an editor . \"[65 ] 5 . ^ Responding to the memes of Lean 's music video for \" Hurt \" ( 2015 ) , Arizona Beverage Company collaborated with Adidas on a sneaker design based on the turquoise and pink can design of Arizona 99-cent teas that had become \" a vaporwave standard\"[77 ] 6 . ^ Harper wrote in 2017 that the genre 's demise was merely a popular talking point , as it is contradicted by the wealth of releases that still appeared on Bandcamp.[36 ] Price commented that these releases were only observed by those who are \" constantly checking the vaporwave charts \" and cited \" countless parody albums of Floral Shoppe , to the point in which there are even full Bandcamp pages dedicated to these innocuous releases . \" [ 35 ] Upcoming entities: Adam, Chuck Person, Contemporary Sapporo, Harper, Langley, Simon Reynolds, Trump, Trumpwave. Next focus: Trumpwave exploits vaporwave",
