      "text_raw": "Active entities: Ann Veal, Barry Zuckerkorn, Ben Stiller, Bob Loblaw, Carl Weathers, Debra Mooney, Henry Winkler, John Krasinski.[93][94][95][96][97][98. Topic: who had recurring roles in the original series Main article : Arrested Development season 5 The fifth season revolves around the mystery of who killed Lucille Austero with the lead suspect being Buster . Netflix confirmed on May 17 , 2017 , that a fifth season featuring the full cast had been ordered.[101 ] The fifth season includes 16 episodes ; the first eight were released on May 29 , 2018 , and the remaining eight episodes premiered on March 15 , 2019.[102][103][104 ] Reception ​ [ edit ] Television ratings ​ [ edit ] The show , while critically acclaimed , did not gain a sizable audience.[5 ] According to the Nielsen ratings system , the show 's first season was the 120th most popular show among households and the 88th among viewers aged 18 to 49 , averaging 6.2 million viewers[105 ] U.S. ratings in the second season averaged about six million viewers , while the third season averaged about four million viewers.[106 ] Fox announced that it would halt the production of the second season at eighteen episodes—four episodes short of the planned season[107 ] For the third season , Fox positioned the show on Mondays at 8:00 p.m. ET.[108 ] Ratings dropped further than previous seasons.[109 ] Upcoming entities: David Bianculli, Tim Stack, Arrested Development, Entertainment Weekly, Fox, the New York Daily News, The Office, Time. Next focus: show would not be airing episode order",
